<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Niger have escalated attacks, killing village heads, their families, worshippers and beheading traditional rulers while burning houses and a palace. Gunmen carried out a mosque attack that killed five people, and police confirmed their responsibility for the mosque and other killings in Lumma Ba’are and Borgu. US forces suffered three soldiers killed and two injured in a separate Niger attack. The broader jihadist insurgency in the Sahel produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Express Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQZFNpWVhjZjNYbWxFZkk2YXhKb2F0cFFFaEhqMU8yZnpMNzBQa3BXVjdNSFVZb21LTG1qR0NZUjU1T21JMDVtOEUtenEyejFvWVF2ei0zWkZqVUZ2N1NoNkVTdXpRdGZKdXFUZldKVWN5TVZEcGx2VWdtZHdnZUZCOG5GLXE4ckpEUkVjU2U3c3pzTE5TZnVWaklrNlNtT0QzZ1ZFOUkxMVJ4QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOUTRVa1hwY1hUSlpXcE5KRlY1azlxZmkwQ0dLOVB6RFJwV2FMak5CYjRPUks4NF9PaXlZcVVtMEdsd3hVM2ozbWlMMUp3Ri1LREE5WXFOb3IyM3c3S3Q3aHJ2LUxpQkY1cEhKVmdKRi1Ra1o3TjZ1ZWJVR0k2UVZfOXpzRWVkeTBIMk40RlNKb096Y2F3TDVQWUdmTUtvX0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPNU14S3dhMzA0SXVNMVdoVHBraVN1NHNsaWFlWWVDaktvMzBBa1RhdFE2VDVSRGR1VFJCMUNNeXJpYldzX0pnczhhTkszSXRBcXV3TEtsclRXai05RFdpUGJ0OGdDeFBPaFhFOFFMTVk2V21jUWwyUS1fcWR4V25hcWR1bnh1ZURHUmVHZGJoeXc5WmNMcmw4ZE5oR2ZFMFpCRXAydDk1U0laOEoxY3NOQVFqX3RLTzJiSUVDNkZfRUVac2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Nation Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX